<title>JORDAN: Jordan buys 100,000 T Argentine wheat at $169.50/T.</title>
<headline>Jordan buys 100,000 T Argentine wheat at $169.50/T.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jordan on Wednesday purchased 100,000 tonnes of Argentine hard red winter wheat at $169.50 per tonne in two lots, for delivery in March and April, traders said.</p>
<p>Traders told Reuters Jordan bought the wheat from Toepfer which will be supplying the wheat in two 50,000 tonnes lots. -- Amman Newsroom +9626-623776</p>
